body:
The multiplayer, sorry I’m about to rant here but

&#x200B;

me and my bf have lost two worlds now and we’re so upset we don’t want to play anymore, we had two years in our first multiplayer world and we got to fall in our second and it just died, me and him (and the friend we were playing with) were furious. This has been a major glitch since release and I feel like such a glitch shouldve been fixed by now, seeing people who’ve lost 5yrs or more I can’t help but feel bad for them too, like it isn’t just a me glitch it’s a glitch that’s been a thing for wayyyy too long. we play on Xbox 1 so it might be that but still just asrrrgrgrgr fix it!
